# stack, Giver of Runes gives the Llanowar Elves protection from colorless; the trigger resolves after it, so the Savannah
# Lions gains it too. Bot2's Ornithopter (colorless) can't block the attacking Lions (the refusal). On turn 7, the
# protection over, it can (the control).

